<title>UK: KfW sets 500 mln mark 10-year COREX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>KfW sets 500 mln mark 10-year COREX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Commerzbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTANLT FUER WIEDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   BASE	 REX INDEX MATURITY    16.APR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     **	  PAY DATE    16.APR.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  100	 FULL FEES   20 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES    **PAYS ANNUAL COUPON LINKED TO REX 10-YEAR INDEX TIMES</p>
<p>81 PERCENT. FIRST COUPON IS 4.76 PERCENT  </p>
<p> LISTING    FFM	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
